<title>FRANCE: Non-residents net French govt bond sellers in Dec.</title>
<headline>Non-residents net French govt bond sellers in Dec.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Figures released on Friday by the finance ministry showed non-resident investors sold a net 6.08 billion francs of French government bonds (OATs and BTANs) in December.</p>
<p>The ministry gave the following unadjusted breakdown (in billions of francs) of the financial account in its balance of payment figures.</p>
<p> DIRECT INVESTMENT			    Dec    Nov     Dec 95</p>
<p>  - Direct investment			-6.39  -6.65    6.91</p>
<p>     - French investment abroad	 -25.34 -10.96  -18.64</p>
<p>     - Foreign investment in France    18.95   4.31   25.55</p>
<p> PORTFOLIO INVESTMENT		     -21.67 -25.46    3.97</p>
<p>  - Residents in foreign securities   -20.61 -24.28   19.78</p>
<p>     - shares				  21.80  -2.04    1.72</p>
<p>     - bonds				  -40.64 -26.96    6.63</p>
<p>     - money market instruments	  -5.79   5.21   12.09</p>
<p>     - derivative products		  4.02  -0.49   -0.66</p>
<p>- Non-residents in French securities   -1.06  -1.19  -15.81</p>
<p>     - shares				   5.55  10.38    7.87</p>
<p>     - bonds				    6.80  -3.69  -25.88</p>
<p>	 - Govt securities(OATs, BTANs)  -6.08   1.28  -35.86</p>
<p>     - money market instruments	 -13.41  -7.87    2.20</p>
<p> OTHER INVESTMENTS			   -1.68  48.66  -36.34</p>
<p>  - Credits				    67.77  23.12   86.87</p>
<p>  - Liabilities			     -69.45  25.54 -123.22</p>
<p> RESERVE ASSETS				-0.02  -0.29   -0.36</p>
<p> TOTAL FINANCIAL ACCOUNT		  -29.75  16.26  -25.82</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5542</p>
